sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant S as Paywall Server
    participant L as Solana
    C->>S: GET /resource
    S-->>C: 402 + asset/amount/recipient/nonce/expiry
    C->>L: Thanh toán token chính xác
    C->>S: Retry + payment proof
    S->>L: Verify transaction và chống replay
    S-->>C: 200 + gated content
